Container image
---------------

The final image stores the project LICENSE and NOTICE at /app and the following
machine-generated, version-specific license bundles under /app/licenses:

- FRONTEND_THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt is produced by the Angular production build
  from the packages actually included in the browser bundle.
- GO_THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt is produced by
  scripts/generate-go-third-party-notices.go from every external module linked
  into the OpenJornada/PocketBase executable, plus the Go standard library.

The Alpine base image and packages retain their own package metadata and remain
subject to their respective upstream licenses. They are not relicensed by
OpenJornada.

Firmware
--------

The M5Stack firmware is a separate artifact and is not included in the
container image. Its dependency inventory and license texts are in
firmware/terminal/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES and firmware/terminal/LICENSES/. The
existing DejaVu font notice applies only to the bitmap font subset embedded in
the firmware.

Build tools
-----------

Node.js, pnpm, the Angular build toolchain, Go compilers, PlatformIO, esptool
and other build-only tools are not shipped as part of the OpenJornada
application artifacts unless a distributor includes them separately. Their
licenses still apply to any separately distributed copies.
